1 2 1 1 1 2 # 3B1
1 2 1 1 4 1 # 1A2
1 2 1 1 2 3 # 3B2
# 1A1 and ...
1 3 1 1 2 2 # 2B2
1 3 1 1 1 1 # 2B1 (ground state is 1B1)
1 3 1 1 1 2 # 3B1
1 3 1 1 4 1 # 1A2
1 3 1 1 2 3 # 3B2
# 2B2 and ...
1 2 2 1 1 1 # 2B1 (ground state is 1B1)
1 2 2 1 1 2 # 3B1
1 2 2 1 4 1 # 1A2
1 2 2 1 2 3 # 3B2
# 2B1 and ...
1 1 1 1 1 2 # 3B1
1 1 1 1 4 1 # 1A2
1 1 1 1 2 3 # 3B2
# 3B1 and ...
1 1 2 1 4 1 # 1A2
1 1 2 1 2 3 # 3B2
# 1A2 and ...
1 4 1 1 2 3 # 3B2
ignore
1
